 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 04 · RAG 条款问答\n",
    "\n",
    "演示如何把 PDF/Markdown 条款文件入知识库，再做问答。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "from actuarial_pilot.rag.qa import ActuarialQA\n",
    "from actuarial_pilot.config import APP_CONFIG\n",
    "\n",
    "# 1. 入索引\n",
    "qa = ActuarialQA()\n",
    "policy_dir = APP_CONFIG.policy_dir\n",
    "files = list(policy_dir.glob(\"*.md\")) + list(policy_dir.glob(\"*.pdf\"))\n",
    "print(f\"发现 {len(files)} 份文件\")\n",
    "if files:\n",
    "    count = qa.ingest(files)\n",
    "    print(f\"已入索引：{count} 个 chunk\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 2. 提问\n",
    "result = qa.ask(\"犹豫期是几天？退保有损失吗？\", top_k=2)\n",
    "print(\"=== 回答 ===\")\n",
    "print(result[\"answer\"])\n",
    "print(\"\\n=== 引用来源 ===\")\n",
    "for i, src in enumerate(result[\"sources\"], 1):\n",
    "    print(f\"[{i}] {src['name']}（第 {src['page']} 页）\")\n",
    "    print(f\"   {src['snippet']}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 工作流\n",
    "\n",
    "1. 把更多公开条款 PDF 放入 `data/policies/`\n",
    "2. 调用 `qa.ingest()` 入索引\n",
    "3. 调用 `qa.ask(question)` 提问\n",
    "\n",
    "Streamlit UI 提供了一键"重建索引"按钮。"
   ]
  }
 ],
